./xmodel/round1033-hf-dossier-delta6-grok46-20260831.md:149:The extra AG-S terms allowed by `fint<18` and `deg_y<3` homogenise to weight `>9` in the weighting `wt(Y)=1`, `wt(Z)=3`, while the distinguished monomial `c X^3 Z^3` is weight 9 and `c ≠ 0` on this row. The Newton face is therefore `(Y^3-Z)^2` with first perturbation `c Z^3` for every reduced `(6,4,9)` equation, not only the associated curve. Puiseux:
