./xmodel/sol-avenues3.log:2643:Abandon immediately if the symmetry is a formal consequence of the already-passing splice/contact tree. Also abandon until deeper data exists if unpinned B tails enter below the conductor in every allowed partition, or if two genuinely different low-tail completions give the same automatically symmetric semigroup. A pass on the P1/P2 pilot is not evidence for the full \(2+r_B\)-branch germ.
