./xmodel/m-inf-hostile-review-sol56-20260831.md:177:4. **A numerical AM semigroup as a rational type-`(8,6)` curve: correctly rejected as an inference, but mistyped.**  Conditions G1--G3 define a numerical AM semigroup and GB--P Theorem 9.5 realizes a local branch; neither is a global rational-realization theorem.  Moreover Galindo rules out `(8,2,31)` at this degree pair altogether.  The replacement unrealized threat is `(8,6,3)` / local `(8,2,29)`.
