+The affine singularity check is closed. With `g=y^3-x^2`,
+
+```text
+f_x = -6x g^2,       f_y = 9y^2 g^2 - 2y.
+```
+
+The equations `f=f_x=f_y=0` have only `(0,0)`: if `g=0`, then
+`f=-y^2`; if `x=0`, then `f=y^2(y^7-1)` and the `y^7=1` points have
