+Modulo `6z^2+8z+5`, one has
+
+```text
+x' == -(27/8)z - 117/32.
+```
+
+Its zero would be `z=-13/12`, but
+`6z^2+8z+5 = 27/8` there. Hence `x'` and `y'` do not vanish together,
+so there are no affine cuspidal branches.
