+The involution `t -> -t` gives multiple fibres exactly at nonzero roots
+of
+
+```text
+q(z)=32z^4+96z^3+168z^2+140z+63 = 32*x(t)/t.
+```
+
+The roots are simple: the Euclidean remainders reduce through
